  "Name": "Dragon Ball Z: Burst Limit",
  "Overview": "Dragon Ball Z: Burst Limit is the first game of the Dragon Ball Z series to hit the Xbox 360 console. The game features detailed graphics and dramatic, seamless battles, expected from a next generation console. The plans are to have characters and movement reminiscent of the animation, and high-intensity battles. During each battle, find conditions to create new dramatic scenes. After the battles, watch a unique story unfold each time you play. There is also a stronger element of offense and defense, due to added energy saving and fighting techniques.",
